{
    "title": "Provident Bank",
    "description": "Start banking wherever you are with the Provident Mobile app for Android, available to all ProvidentConnect Online Banking participants! Provident\u2019s Mobile Banking Services allow you to check balances, pay bills, make transfers, and make check deposits. Need to find the Provident branch or ATM closest to you? Provident\u2019s Mobile app will discover your location and provide you with addresses and phone numbers on your Android Phone or Tablet! \r\n\r\nAvailable features include: \r\n\r\nAccount Balances \r\n- Check your account balance and search recent transactions by date, amount, or check number. (Available on Wear OS)\r\n\r\nBill Pay \r\n- Pay bills, review scheduled bills, and review previously paid bills from your Android Phone or Tablet. \r\n\r\nTransfers \r\n- Easily transfer cash between your accounts. \r\n\r\nLocations \r\n- Find nearby Provident branches and ATMs using your Android\u2019s built-in GPS. Additionally, you can search by zip code or address. \r\n\r\nMobile Check Deposit \r\n- Deposit checks while on the go with your Android Phone or Tablet.\r\n\r\nWear OS is supported.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Start banking wherever you are with the Provident Mobile app for Android, available to all ProvidentConnect Online Banking participants! Provident\u2019s Mobile Banking Services allow you to check balances, pay bills, make transfers, and make check deposits. Need to find the Provident branch or ATM closest to you? Provident\u2019s Mobile app will discover your location and provide you with addresses and phone numbers on your Android Phone or Tablet! <br><br>Available features include: <br><br>Account Balances <br>- Check your account balance and search recent transactions by date, amount, or check number. (Available on Wear OS)<br><br>Bill Pay <br>- Pay bills, review scheduled bills, and review previously paid bills from your Android Phone or Tablet. <br><br>Transfers <br>- Easily transfer cash between your accounts. <br><br>Locations <br>- Find nearby Provident branches and ATMs using your Android\u2019s built-in GPS. Additionally, you can search by zip code or address. <br><br>Mobile Check Deposit <br>- Deposit checks while on the go with your Android Phone or Tablet.<br><br>Wear OS is supported.",
